      "writtenOn": "2022-07-13T20:52:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Let\u0027s consolidate the factory function to just `Vertices(SkVertices::VertexMode, bool hasColor, bool hasTexCoords)`, and the implementation we can select from the 8 Renderer varieties that we need.\n\nThis matches the existing trend of having Renderer factories for the core concept/approach, that take parameters to select the actual instances (e.g. StencilTesselatedWedges takes a fill type, or TextSDF takes a bool). We can assert in the implementation that the kTriangleFan value isn\u0027t encountered (SkVertices should have converted that by the time the Builder is done).",
