      "writtenOn": "2022-07-13T20:52:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Skia style is a little different for constructor params. We keep the `:` and the `,` separating fields aligned, so it\u0027d end up more or less:\n\n    VerticesRenderStep::VerticesRenderStep(...)\n            : RenderStep(...)\n            , fHasColor(hasColor)\n            , fHasTexture(hasTexture) {}\n            \nThis makes it pretty convenient to add new fields but takes some getting used to.",
      "range": {
